# Witch on a Broom: she flies across her row, high above the turf, facing +x.
# A big pointed hat and a long broom make her read from far above.
size 13 13 5
voxel 0.1
colors
  w wood
  y straw
  r purpleDark
  h ink
  H purple
  g witchSkin
  k ink
